# .gitleaksignore
# Documented allowlist for verified Gitleaks false positives.
#
# When Gitleaks flags an inert test token, mock hash, or public documentation string
# that is confirmed NOT to be a real credential:
# 1. Obtain the exact finding fingerprint from the Gitleaks run report.
# 2. Add the fingerprint on a new line below.
# 3. Add a clear explanatory comment stating why the finding is inert.
#
# WARNING: NEVER ignore genuine API keys, private keys, tokens, or production credentials.
# Any real credential must be revoked/rotated immediately, not suppressed in this file.
